  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responding to winterization program in Mykolaiv Mykolaiv City/Oblast in Ukraine II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at supporting Mykolaiv Municipality and region in providing the conflict-affected population with basic lifesaving services, including emergency repair of heating and water supply. The project will result in the provision of basic lifesaving services to the conflict-affected population and the repairment of public services, such as water supply, sewage, and heating systems, and the delivery of  requested goods/materials/equipment for required repairs.</narrative>
  </description>
